> Genuine CAD surfaces and declared occupancy preparation

Use the same42original ModelNet10 chair0/sofa1/table2objects as the point
reports:per category,first eight lexical official train objects fit,next two
validate,first four official test objects are held out. Original OFF meshes,
archive SHA256 and object IDs are retained. This custom three-class subset is
not a full ModelNet40 benchmark;cross-source near-duplicate shapes are not certified absent.

The report declares its own sampled-SURFACE occupancy:Double tensors compute
triangle areas and65536area-weighted barycentric samples,seed1193+objectID.
Center on the original vertex bounding-box midpoint,divide by its maximum half
extent,then convert toFloat32. Map floor((xyz+1)*14.5)+1,clamp1..30 and threshold
tensor segment counts. The result has an empty one-voxel border. This is not
solid filling,triangle/voxel intersection or the published benchmark preparation.
Every face draw,uniform pair,center/radius and original object identity is saved
for independent reconstruction. No test label influences voxelization.

```{cpp, flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  const std::filesystem::path cache = dm::datasets::data_home();
  dm::datasets::prepare_example_data("mesh", (cache / "modelnet").string());
  dm::datasets::prepare_example_data("voxel", (cache / "modelnet").string());
}
```
