\alttext(Exact recorded true-row predicted-column counts rendered by the confusion-matrix SVG API.)

> Conclusion

The architecture,regularization and discrete rotation mechanism are checked independently from held-out quality. Complete source identities and a declared sampled-surface preparation make the tiny custom42object experiment reproducible without a published voxelization or benchmark accuracy claim.

> References

- [Maturana and Scherer(2015),VoxNet:A3DConvolutional Neural Network for Real-Time Object Recognition](https://publications.ri.cmu.edu/voxnet-a-3d-convolutional-neural-network-for-real-time-object-recognition).
- [Original Princeton ModelNet data](https://3dvision.princeton.edu/projects/2014/3DShapeNets/).
